	<entry name="SeparatistRegimentsCity" value="City of the New Humanity"/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegimentsCityDescription" value="<string name='Traits/CityDescription'/>"/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegimentsCityFlavor" value="The cities of the New Humanity are neither temples nor prisons; they are refuges, fortress-communities. The walls keep out the enemy, the roofs keep out the rain, and inside, people live. The land around them has been scorched by war, but engineers are already calculating where to dig new mines. No fanaticism. No grand ambitions. Just life. And that is enough to hold the line."/>
	
